# ==========================================================
# MAUSAM — ZERO-SECRET / KEYLESS CORE CONFIGURATION
# ==========================================================
# MAUSAM operates out of the box with zero API keys, tokens,
# Redis credentials, or database URLs required:
#   - Weather:     Public Open-Meteo API
#   - Air Quality: Public Open-Meteo Air Quality (CAMS / NAQI)
#   - Marine:      Public Open-Meteo Marine API
#   - Warnings:    Public NDMA SACHET & IMD CAP RSS feeds
#   - Radar:       Public RainViewer feed
#   - Assistant:   Grounded local meteorological assistant
#   - Cache:       In-memory LRU + stale-while-revalidate cache
#   - Database:    Disabled by default (in-memory fallback)
#
# Optional institutional/commercial integrations (direct IMD,
# direct CPCB, direct INCOIS, AccuWeather, Google Weather,
# remote AI gateway, Upstash Redis, PostgreSQL) are disabled
# in the default keyless runtime configuration.
# ==========================================================
